        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/extras/70bfa1e76e6c40b4f114ebd59af89aff.avif?t=1755518217\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/extras_big/70bfa1e76e6c40b4f114ebd59af89aff.avif?t=1755518217 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen Boy’s girlfriend has been kidnapped by the sinister Lord Static!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters worse, Screen Boy has been thrown deep into a dark, treacherous well—trapped in a labyrinth of underground caves crawling with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must fight his way to the surface, dodge deadly traps, outsmart Lord Static’s loyal henchmen, and rescue Screen Girl before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he rise from the shadows and save the day, or will the Evil Lord static silence him forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Adventure Platformer designed to take you back to the 90's with Big Bosses, traps , pests and so much more. play with keyboard or joypad your game, your choice.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/extras/70bfa1e76e6c40b4f114ebd59af89aff.avif?t=1755518217\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/extras_big/70bfa1e76e6c40b4f114ebd59af89aff.avif?t=1755518217 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen Boy’s girlfriend has been kidnapped by the sinister Lord Static!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters worse, Screen Boy has been thrown deep into a dark, treacherous well—trapped in a labyrinth of underground caves crawling with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must fight his way to the surface, dodge deadly traps, outsmart Lord Static’s loyal henchmen, and rescue Screen Girl before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he rise from the shadows and save the day, or will the Evil Lord static silence him forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Adventure Platformer designed to take you back to the 90's with Big Bosses, traps , pests and so much more. play with keyboard or joypad your game, your choice.</p>",
        "short_description": "Screen Boy is a fun 2D platformer adventure full of excitement and danger! Join Screen Boy as he explores colourful worlds, dodges traps, and takes on massive bosses. With smooth controls and action-packed levels, it’s a thrilling quest that keeps you playing! Can you Save Screen Girl?",
